{"sourceUrl":"https://itp.cas.cn/yjs/zs/xly/202504/t20250430_7640725.html","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:12.172438+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://itp.cas.cn/yjs/zs/xly/202504/t20250430_7640725.html","html":"<div>\n<h1>2025年理论物理大学生夏令营报名通知（更新举办日期）</h1>\n<div>\n<font>时间：2025-04-30</font>\n</div>\n<p><div><p><span><span><span>中国科学院理论物理研究所将于2025年7月5日-8日举办“</span></span></span><span><span>2025</span></span><span><span><span>年理论物理大学生夏令营”活动。请有意参加夏令营的同学，按照如下要求完成报名事宜。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><strong>一、申请条件</strong></span><span> </span></span></span></p><p><span><span>1</span></span><span><span><span>．中华人民共和国公民，拥护中国共产党的领导，热爱科学事业，道德品质良好，遵纪守法。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>2. </span></span><span><span><span>全国高校本科三年级在校生，能获得所在学校当年推荐免试研究生资格。 </span></span></span></p><p><span><span>3</span></span><span><span><span>．诚实守信，品行端正，学风优良，无任何考试作弊和剽窃他人学术成果记录，无任何违法违纪受处分记录。 </span></span></span></p><p><span><span>4</span></span><span><span><span>．大学本科阶段攻读物理学或相关专业，学习成绩优异，有较好的科研潜力，具有较强的调查研究、分析问题、解决问题能力。在学期间所学专业主干课无不及格科目。 </span></span></span></p><p><span><span>5</span></span><span><span><span>．英语程度良好，具有较强的英语听、说、读、写及综合应用能力。 </span></span></span></p><p><span><span>6</span></span><span><span><span>．身体健康状况符合规定的体检要求，心理健康状况良好。 </span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><strong>二、报名申请和录取</strong></span><span> </span></span></span></p><p><span><span>1. </span></span><span><span><span>夏令营实行网上报名的方式，报名截止日期为</span></span></span><span><span>2025</span></span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span><span>日。 </span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>报名学生登录http</span></span></span><a href=\"http://kjxt.ucas.ac.cn/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span><span>://kjxt.ucas.ac.cn/</span></span></span></a><span><span><span>，点击右侧的</span><span>“大学生夏令营报名”</span><span>，注册成功后按要求填写各项信息。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><strong>填写报名信息时请注意： </strong></span></span><span><span><strong>“意向研究方向”栏，请填以下内容：按意向程度由高到低填写方向序号</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><strong>+</strong></span></span><span><span><span><strong>同意调剂至其他方向</strong></span></span></span><span><span><strong>/</strong></span></span><span><span><span><strong>不同意调剂至其他方向；“意向导师”栏，请</strong></span></span></span><span><strong>按意向程度由高到低填写，最多填写三位。</strong></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>附表</span></span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span><span>：招生方向及导师列表</span></span></span></p><center><div><table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span>研究方向序号</span></span></span></p></td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span>研究方向名称</span></span></span></p></td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span>导师列表</span></span></span></p></td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span>1</span></span></p></td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span>粒子物理和量子场论</span></span></span></p></td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span>李田军、刘纯、宋宁强、吴岳良、杨金民、杨一玻、于江浩、周宇峰</span></span></span></p></td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span>2</span></span></p></td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span>超弦理论和场论</span></span></span></span></p></td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span>何颂、李微、吴洁强、杨刚</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span>3</span></span></p></td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span>引力理论与宇宙学</span></span></span></span></p></td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span>郭宗宽、黄庆国、李理、皮石</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span>4</span></span></p></td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span>强子与原子核理论</span></span></span></span></p></td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span>郭奉坤、周善贵</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span>5</span></span></p></td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span>统计物理与复杂系统</span></span></span></span></p></td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span>金瑜亮、田矗舜、张潘、周海军</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span>6</span></span></p></td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span>软物质与生物物理</span></span></span></span></p></td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span>孟凡龙、史华林、王维康、王延颋</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span>7</span></span></p></td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span>凝聚态理论</span></span></span></span></p></td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span>陈锟、李伟、覃绍京、宋昊、苏刚、吴贤新、张田田、周森</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span>8</span></span></p></td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span>量子物理</span></span></span></span></p></td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span>石弢、王东升、王颖丹</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span>9</span></span></p></td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span>等离子体与高能量密度物理</span></span></span></span></p></td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span>弓正</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></center><p><span><span><span>注：实际招生导师以招生目录为准</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>2. </span></span><span><span><span>除网上报名申请外，申请者还需提交以下材料： </span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span><span>）夏令营申请表（网报系统生成，申请表打印后，请仔细阅读且履行个人签字栏相关要求，并在签字处亲笔签字）。 </span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span><span>）《中国科学院理论物理研究所接收推荐免试硕士生申请表》（附件</span></span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span><span>，亲笔签字）。 </span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span><span>）所在学校教务部门（或院系）出具并加盖公章的大学本科前三年所修课程成绩单（五年制的提供前四年课程成绩单）。 </span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span>4</span></span><span><span><span>）英语四级或六级证书复印件。 </span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span><span>）身份证复印件。 </span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span><span>）专家推荐书（附件</span></span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span><span>，自愿提供）。 </span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span><span>）在公开发行的学术刊物或全国性学术会议上发表的学术论文、所获专利或其它原创性工作成果的复印件或证明（自愿提供）。 </span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span>8</span></span><span><span><span>）大学期间的获奖证书复印件（自愿提供）。 </span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>材料请按以上顺序扫描至一个</span></span></span><span><span>PDF</span></span><span><span><span>文件中，于</span></span></span><span><span>2025</span></span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span><span>日前发送至</span></span></span><span><span>summer@itp.ac.cn</span></span><span><span><span>，邮件标题及文件名称请按</span><span>“</span><span>所在学校</span></span></span><span><span>+</span></span><span><span><span>姓名</span></span></span><span><span>+2025</span></span><span><span><span>年夏令营</span><span>”</span><span>命名。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>3.</span></span><span><span><span>报名截止后，我所将组织专家审定申请者的入营资格，请申请者及时在报名系统中点击</span><span>“申请进度”</span><span>查看申请结果。 未入选者，不再另行通知。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><strong>三、招生宣讲</strong></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>近期，我所将组织招生宣讲活动，请同学们关注我所网站或公众号相关通知。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><strong>四、联系方式</strong></span><span> </span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>通讯地址：北京市海淀区中关村东路</span></span></span><span><span>55</span></span><span><span><span>号理论物理研究所（邮编：</span></span></span><span><span>100190</span></span><span><span><span>） </span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>联系人：孙老师 </span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>电话：</span></span></span><span><span>010-62555377</span></span></p><p><span><span>Email</span></span><span><span><span>：</span></span></span><span><span>summer@itp.ac.cn </span></span></p><p><span><span><span>附件：</span></span></span></p><ol><li><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://itp.cas.cn/govapp/lib/ueditor_demo/ueditor2/dialogs/attachment/fileTypeImages/icon_doc.gif\"/><a href=\"https://itp.cas.cn/yjs/zs/xly/202504/P020250430419136045603.doc\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"附件1：中国科学院理论物理研究所接收推荐免试生申请表.doc\">附件1：中国科学院理论物理研究所接收推荐免试生申请表.doc</a></li><li><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://itp.cas.cn/govapp/lib/ueditor_demo/ueditor2/dialogs/attachment/fileTypeImages/icon_doc.gif\"/><a href=\"https://itp.cas.cn/yjs/zs/xly/202504/P020250430419136192719.doc\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"附件2：2025年大学生夏令营专家推荐书.doc\">附件2：2025年大学生夏令营专家推荐书.doc</a></li></ol><p><br/></p><p><span><span><span>欢迎扫描下方二维码关注</span></span></span><span><span>:</span></span><span><span><span>中国科学院理论物理研究所</span></span></span></p><p><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://itp.cas.cn/yjs/zs/xly/202504/W020250430416390915627_ORIGIN.jpg\"/></p><p></p><p><br/></p></div></p>\n</div>","textSha256":"e23020208072ea7ee77cd91aa1ca66e39945d9925d0185a19b2ded7d1ab74abd","textLength":1476,"sourceSha256":"c7e54128990e03a4be0191e2437b6054318302e039aa74e0672c5acb5928a5f0","selector":"article-like:fl w100 mart15 gl_dp_content content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-5ccc2d0bb2e5fe8aed3e","title":"2025年中国科学院理论物理研究所理论物理大学生夏令营报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:12.172438+00:00"}
